SUB = "Sub-warp form: logical warps of 4, 8 and 16 lanes inside one hardware warp, shuffles with the full warp mask (the xor partner stays inside the segment), ballots on the full warp masked to the segment, the redux.min as one full-warp redux per logical warp with the identity in the other lanes (T37, T40) and the tie branch made uniform over the hardware warp with one any-vote. No BSSY from partial-mask collectives (the W1 sub-warp controls carry them). "
